(?block:block, ?otherblock:block)] Ignore Effects: [] Option Spec: Pick(?robot:robot, ?block:block</note>\n</biblStruct>\n\n<biblStruct status=\"extracted\" xml:id=\"b66\">\n\t<monogr>\n\t\t<title level=\"m\" type=\"main\">This environment has goal predicates: {CupFilled(?cup:cup)}. We include the predicate JugFilled(?jug:jug) in the initial set of predicates because it was very challenging to have a VLM to determine this especially with the graphics in the simulator</title>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><surname>Coffee</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t\t<imprint/>\n\t</monogr>\n\t<note>It has initial operators: NSRT-PickJugFromTable: Parameters: [?robot:robot, ?jug:jug] Preconditions: [] Add Effects: [] Delete Effects: [] Ignore Effects: [] Option Spec: PickJug(?robot:robot, ?jug:jug</note>\n</biblStruct>\n\n<biblStruct status=\"extracted\" xml:id=\"b67\">\n\t<monogr>\n\t\t<title/>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><surname>Nsrt-Placejuginmachine</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t\t<imprint/>\n\t</monogr>\n\t<note>robot:robot, ?jug:jug, ?machine:coffee_machine] Preconditions: [] Add Effects: [] Delete Effects: [] Ignore Effects: [] Option Spec: PlaceJugInMachine(?robot:robot, ?jug:jug, ?machine:coffee_machine</note>\n</biblStruct>\n\n<biblStruct status=\"extracted\" xml:id=\"b68\">\n\t<monogr>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><surname>Nsrt-Pourfromnowhere</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t\t<title level=\"m\">Option Spec: Pour(?robot:robot, ?jug:jug, ?cup:cup), NSRT-TurnMachineOn: Parameters</title>\n\t\t<imprint/>\n\t</monogr>\n\t<note>Parameters: [?robot:robot, ?jug:jug, ?cup:cup] Preconditions: [] Add Effects CupFilled(?cup:cup)] Delete Effects: [] Ignore Effects robot:robot, ?jug:jug, ?machine:coffee_machine] Preconditions: [] Add Effects: [JugFilled(?jug:jug)] Delete Effects: [] Ignore Effects: [] Option Spec: TurnMachineOn(?robot:robot, ?machine:coffee_machine), NSRT-Twist: Parameters: [?robot:robot, ?jug:jug] Preconditions: [] Add Effects: [] Delete Effects: [] Ignore Effects: [] Option Spec: Twist(?robot:robot, ?jug:jug</note>\n</biblStruct>\n\n<biblStruct status=\"extracted\" xml:id=\"b69\">\n\t<analytic>\n\t\t<title level=\"a\" type=\"main\">This has the same set of goal predicates and operators as Cover. Balance. This has the goal predicate: {MachineOn(?x:machine)}. Here we consider a continual learning setting where the agent is initialized with the abstractions commonly found in Blocks</title>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><forename type=\"first\">Cover</forename><surname>Heavy</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t</analytic>\n\t<monogr>\n\t\t<title level=\"m\">ClearPlate(?x:plate), DirectlyOn(?x:block, ?y:block), DirectlyOnPlate(?x:block, ?y:plate), GripperOpen(?x:robot), Holding(?x:block)}. The initial set of operators is: NSRT-PickFromTable: Parameters</title>\n\t\t<imprint/>\n\t</monogr>\n\t<note>They are {Clear(?x:block ?block:block, ?robot:robot, ?plate:plate] Preconditions: [Clear(?block:block), DirectlyOnPlate(?block:block, ?plate:plate), GripperOpen(?robot:robot) Add Effects Holding(?block:block)] Delete Effects: [Clear(?block:block), DirectlyOnPlate(?block:block, ?plate:plate), GripperOpen(?robot:robot)] Ignore Effects: [] Option Spec: Pick(?robot:robot, ?block:block</note>\n</biblStruct>\n\n<biblStruct status=\"extracted\" xml:id=\"b70\">\n\t<monogr>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><surname>Nsrt-Putonplate</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t\t<title level=\"m\">Delete Effects: [ClearPlate(?plate:plate)</title>\n\t\t<imprint/>\n\t</monogr>\n\t<note>Parameters: [?block:block, ?robot:robot, ?plate:plate] Preconditions: [ClearPlate(?plate:plate), Holding(?block:block)] Add Effects: [Clear(?block:block), DirectlyOnPlate(?block:block, ?plate:plate), GripperOpen(?robot:robot) Holding(?block:block)] Ignore Effects: [] Option Spec: PutOnPlate(?robot:robot, ?plate:plate), NSRT-Stack: Parameters: [?block:block, ?otherblock:block, ?robot:robot] Preconditions: [Clear(?otherblock:block), Holding(?block:block)] Add Effects: [Clear(?block:block), DirectlyOn(?block:block, ?otherblock:block), GripperOpen(?robot:robot)] Delete Effects: [Clear(?otherblock:block), Holding(?block:block)] Ignore Effects: [] Option Spec: Stack(?robot:robot, ?otherblock:block</note>\n</biblStruct>\n\n<biblStruct status=\"extracted\" xml:id=\"b71\">\n\t<monogr>\n\t\t<title/>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><surname>Nsrt-Unstack</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t\t<imprint/>\n\t</monogr>\n\t<note>Parameters: [?block:block, ?otherblock:block, ?robot:robot] Preconditions: [Clear(?block:block), DirectlyOn(?block:block, ?otherblock:block), GripperOpen(?robot:robot) Add Effects: [Clear(?otherblock:block), Holding(?block:block)] Delete Effects: [Clear(?block:block), DirectlyOn(?block:block, ?otherblock:block), GripperOpen(?robot:robot)] Ignore Effects: [] Option Spec: Pick(?robot:robot, ?block:block</note>\n</biblStruct>\n\n<biblStruct status=\"extracted\" xml:id=\"b72\">\n\t<monogr>\n\t\t<title/>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><surname>Nsrt-Turnmachineon</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t\t<imprint/>\n\t</monogr>\n\t<note>robot:robot, ?machine:machine, ?plate1:plate, ?plate2:plate] Preconditions: [] Add Effects: [MachineOn(?machine:machine)] Delete Effects: [] Ignore Effects: [] Option Spec: TurnMachineOn(?robot:robot, ?plate1:plate, ?plate2:plate</note>\n</biblStruct>\n\n\t\t\t\t</listBibl>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</back>\n\t</text>\n</TEI>\n","pdf_hash":"7f0de61907c9f208921f2ce3d3fb2ffc7ba55a9aa248b463098a11d7265e1bf4","tables":[{"table_id":"tab_0","section_path_id":"1~21","section_ordinal":34,"caption":"Table 1 :","coordinates":null,"cells":[{"row":0,"column":0,"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"text":"10","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":134,"end":136},"digest":"5953e34a4ff49cfb2487c68e790d5a642d265e12a4426e5e564f164894bb854a"},{"row":0,"column":1,"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"text":"","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":136,"end":136},"digest":"7e8d5b72d290ba59f0edbe3d6f961eea1a534c250a6ef2cac5b85c